INT. TREASURE OF THE LOST PHARAOH - ESCAPE ROOM - DAY

A fake tomb, all plaster and foam. Hieroglyphs in glow paint. A sarcophagus with a fake mummy. A digital countdown above the door: 02:14.

Five people stuffed into a space for four.

BECCA ANDERSEN, 30s, bachelorette sash, runs her fingers over a hieroglyph wall. TARIQ HASAN, 30s, polo shirt, crouches over a stone tablet. GRANDMA LOLA, 80, bedazzled tracksuit, sits on the sarcophagus lid eating a granola bar. UNCLE FESTUS, 60s, safari hat, clutches a flashlight like a sword. MORTIMER (V.O.), the game master, speaks from a speaker above the door.

MORTIMER (V.O.)
(speaker)
Two minutes remain.

BECCA
Tariq, what does the tablet say?

TARIQ
It says "pull the lever."

BECCA
What lever?

FESTUS
This lever!

He yanks a wall lever. A foam block drops from the ceiling and bonks him on the head. He staggers. Tariq catches him. They both topple over the coffin lid. Lola doesn't move.

LOLA
Festus, you broke the clue.

FESTUS
I did not break it. It broke me.

TARIQ
Festus, he's right. That wasn't the lever.

BECCA
Which he?

TARIQ
Festus.

BECCA
Which Festus?

TARIQ
Becca, there's only one Festus.

BECCA
Then say "Festus is right."

TARIQ
Festus is right.

FESTUS
Thank you.

MORTIMER (V.O.)
(speaker)
One minute remains.

Becca spins. Tariq scrambles. Festus staggers to his feet. They all bump into each other and scatter in different directions, hands patting walls.

BECCA
There's a hole!

TARIQ
Where?

BECCA
Right here!

FESTUS
That's my ear.

LOLA
That's the hole.

She points calmly with a granola bar to a plastic scarab in the sarcophagus's eye socket. Becca freezes. Tariq stops. Festus stops. All three look at Lola.

BECCA
How did you...

LOLA
I read the manual.

TARIQ
There is a manual?

LOLA
Next to the sarcophagus.

They look. A laminated card, taped to the lid: "Press the scarab."

FESTUS
Oh.

BECCA
Oh.

TARIQ
Oh.

Becca presses the scarab. A click. The countdown stops at 00:07. A door pops open. Bright light. A tiny trumpet fanfare plays.

MORTIMER (V.O.)
(speaker, flat)
Congratulations. You have escaped.

The four of them blink in the light. Lola finishes her granola bar.

LOLA
I want to do the Pirate one next.
